 532:Source/js/jsdtoa.c **** /* Largest possible base 10 exponent. Any exponent larger than this will
 533:Source/js/jsdtoa.c ****  * already produce underflow or overflow, so there's no need to worry about
 534:Source/js/jsdtoa.c ****  * additional digits.
 535:Source/js/jsdtoa.c ****  */
 536:Source/js/jsdtoa.c **** static int maxExponent = 511;
 537:Source/js/jsdtoa.c **** 
