 552:Source/js/jsdtoa.c **** };
 553:Source/js/jsdtoa.c **** 
 554:Source/js/jsdtoa.c **** /* Parse a decimal ASCII floating-point number, optionally preceded by white
 555:Source/js/jsdtoa.c ****  * space. Must have form "-I.FE-X", where I is the integer part of the
 556:Source/js/jsdtoa.c ****  * mantissa, F is the fractional part of the mantissa, and X is the exponent.
 557:Source/js/jsdtoa.c ****  * Either of the signs may be "+", "-", or omitted. Either I or F may be
 558:Source/js/jsdtoa.c ****  * omitted, or both. The decimal point isn't necessary unless F is present.
 559:Source/js/jsdtoa.c ****  * The "E" may actually be an "e". E and X may both be omitted (but not just
 560:Source/js/jsdtoa.c ****  * one).
 561:Source/js/jsdtoa.c ****  */
 562:Source/js/jsdtoa.c **** double
