 572:Source/js/jsdtoa.c **** 
 573:Source/js/jsdtoa.c **** 	/* Exponent that derives from the fractional part. Under normal
 574:Source/js/jsdtoa.c **** 	 * circumstances, it is the negative of the number of digits in F.
 575:Source/js/jsdtoa.c **** 	 * However, if I is very long, the last digits of I get dropped
