 577:Source/js/jsdtoa.c **** 	 * unnecessary overflow on I alone). In this case, fracExp is
 578:Source/js/jsdtoa.c **** 	 * incremented one for each dropped digit.
 579:Source/js/jsdtoa.c **** 	 */
 580:Source/js/jsdtoa.c **** 	int fracExp = 0;
